         <title>AstroDiffraction V1.7.1 (macOS Apple Silicon)</title>
         <description>
            <p>Native PCL Process, build 1.7.1.0002. Adjustable bright-star widening, extended physical far fields, bounded-memory FFT scratch, optical-cache improvements, SDK security backports, hardened preset I/O, and complete user documentation and third-party licenses.</p>
            <p>Installed under Process &gt; Convolution &gt; AstroDiffraction. Requires PixInsight 1.9.5 and macOS 14 or later.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
